      ~0Cฺฤฤฟ ~0Eฺฤฤฟ ~0Aฺ  ฟ ~0Bฺฤฤฟ
      ~0Cฺฤฤู ~0Eณ  ณ ~0Aภฤฤด ~0Bรฤฤด
      ~0Cภฤฤู ~0Eภฤฤู ~0A   ู ~0Bภฤฤู

~06ออออ~0Eอออ ~0FHOW TO PLAY ~0Eออออออออ~06ออออออออออออออออออออออ

The board has ~0F4 x 4~07 squares. Every move slides
~0Fall~07 the tiles as far as they go, up, down, left
or right. Two tiles with the same number that run
into each other merge into one tile of their sum:

        ~1F 2 ~07 + ~1F 2 ~07 = ~2F 4 ~07     ~3F 8 ~07 + ~3F 8 ~07 = ~4F 16 ~07

After each move a new tile shows up on an empty
square: a ~0F2~07, or now and then (one time in ten)
a ~0F4~07. Make a ~0E2048~07 tile to win. The game is over
when the board is full and no two tiles next to
each other are the same.

~02ออออ~0Aอออ ~0FSCORE ~0Aออออออออ~02ออออออออออออออออออออออออออออ

Every merge scores the value of the new tile: two
~0F64~07 tiles that meet give ~0F128~07 points. The eight
best scores are kept, with your name, and ~0EH~07 shows
them. ~0FMOVES~07 counts the moves of this game.

~09ออออ~0Bอออ ~0FTIPS ~0Bออออออออ~09อออออออออออออออออออออออออออออ

 ~0E* ~07Keep the biggest tile in a corner, and build
   the row next to it in order.
 ~0E* ~07Use mostly two or three directions: a move
   the other way can pull the big tile out of
   its corner.
 ~0E* ~07Merge small tiles early, before they block
   the board.

~01ออออ~09อออ ~0FCONTROLS ~09ออออออออ~01อออออออออออออออออออออออออ

