 ~0E* ~0FHelp / about~08. . . . . . ~09? ~07/ ~09!
 ~0E* ~0FQuit~08. . . . . . . . . . ~0CESC

The game is saved when you quit and goes on the
next time. On the title screen, ~0AENTER~07 starts
and ~0CESC~07 leaves.
